cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the article and this software."
title: "Analysis code: salivary and plasma cytokine kinetics during experimental human endotoxaemia"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB and Python code that makes the data figures and all tables of the article
  "Salivary and plasma cytokine kinetics during experimental human endotoxaemia:
  macrophage inflammatory protein-1α and -1β as candidate non-invasive biomarkers",
  including a compartmental plasma-to-saliva model of ten cytokines fitted with
  bootstrap uncertainty. Participant data are not included.
type: software
